      "id": "claim_e0005baa81c8456bb9986cebe0ed4311",
      "statement": "test_slugify.py is the repository's only automated check: a single pytest file with one TestSlugify class of twelve hand-written test methods that import slugify() directly and verify it with plain assert statements (no fixtures, marks, parametrization, or plugin configuration), and nothing else in the repository calls slugify() or runs tests.",
