    {
      "id": "claim_0772aec8b06941e89cbf781d7db51f20",
      "statement": "The suite runs with `pytest test_slugify.py` (optionally `-v`) from the repository root; pytest is imported directly with no requirements file, lockfile, or pytest/pytest.ini/tox configuration anywhere in the repo, no CI hook runs the suite automatically, and an `if __name__ == \"__main__\":` guard calling `pytest.main([__file__, \"-v\"])` also allows running the file directly with python.",
