    {
      "id": "claim_d3b8fdb6bbb343ffb05560491d3577b0",
      "statement": "test_already_slugified pins idempotency — slugify(\"hello-world\") and slugify(\"already-a-slug\") are unchanged — because every pipeline stage is a no-op or fixed point for slug-shaped input, so re-slugging stored slugs is lossless; this is why the idempotency group depends on all pipeline stages.",
